review_notes = "Useful pale aged cement/render finish. The reduced normal strength and larger repeat calm the initial fibrous read enough for localized wall-finish use. It should remain an applied finish over older structural substrate rather than defining the whole bunker shell. Its broad mottling already supplies some baseline age, so later EAF4 wear should remain restrained."
